{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-388", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-authors", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "quote-namakkal-tamizhan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: நாமக்கல் கவிஞர் வெ. இராமலிங்கனாரின் புகழ்பெற்ற பாடல் அடியை நிறைவு செய்க:\n\"தமிழன் என்றொரு இனம் உண்டு;\nதனியே அவற்கொரு ______ உண்டு\""}], "options": {"A": "வீரம்", "B": "புகழ்", "C": "நாடு", "D": "குணம்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC PYQ குறிப்பு: 'தமிழன் என்றொரு இனம் உண்டு; தனியே அவற்கொரு குணம் உண்டு' என்பது நாமக்கல் கவிஞரின் அழியாப் புகழ்பெற்ற வரிகளாகும். விடை: குணம்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Complete the famous poetic line by Namakkal Kavignar V. Ramalinganar:\n\"Thamizhan enroru inam undu;\nThaniye avarkoru ______ undu\""}], "options": {"A": "Veeram", "B": "Pugazh", "C": "Naadu", "D": "Gunam"}, "explanation": "TNPSC PYQ Fact: The famous concluding word is 'Gunam' (character/attribute)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 3, "chapter": null, "section": null