{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-408", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match-pagupatha-morphemes", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பகுபத உறுப்புகளையும் 'வந்தனன்' [வா(வ) + த்(ந்) + த் + அன் + அன்] சொல்லில் உள்ள உறுப்புகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) வா (வ) - 1. ஆண்பால் வினைமுற்று விகுதி\n(b) த் - 2. இறந்தகால இடைநிலை\n(c) முன் நின்ற அன் - 3. குறுகிய பகுதி (விகாரம்)\n(d) பின் நின்ற அன் - 4. சாரியை"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-2, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-2, c-4, d-1"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: வா(வ) - குறுகிய பகுதி (3), த் - இறந்தகால இடைநிலை (2), முன்னின்ற அன் - சாரியை (4), பின்னின்ற அன் - ஆண்பால் வினைமுற்று விகுதி (1). சரியான பொருத்தம்: a-3, b-2, c-4, d-1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the grammatical constituents in 'Vandhanan' [Vaa(Va) + th(n) + th + an + an]:\n(a) Vaa (Va) - 1. Masculine finite verb suffix\n(b) th - 2. Past tense infix\n(c) Preceding 'an' - 3. Shortened root (Vikaaram)\n(d) Concluding 'an' - 4. Saariyai"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-2, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-2, c-4, d-1"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: Vaa(Va) -> Shortened root (3), th -> Past infix (2), first an -> Saariyai (4), second an -> Masculine suffix (1). Correct match is a-3, b-2, c-4, d-1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "வா (வ)", "content_en": "Vaa (Va)"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "த்", "content_en": "th"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "முன் நின்ற அன்", "content_en": "Preceding 'an'"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "பின் நின்ற அன்", "content_en": "Concluding 'an'"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "ஆண்பால் வினைமுற்று விகுதி", "content_en": "Masculine finite suffix"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "இறந்தகால இடைநிலை", "content_en": "Past tense infix"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "குறுகிய பகுதி (விகாரம்)", "content_en": "Shortened root"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "சாரியை", "content_en": "Saariyai"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 61, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": null, "exam_name": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2 / VAO Benchmark", "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "match", "vandhanan_morphemes_match"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-409", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match-rare-orezhuthu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அரிய ஓரெழுத்து ஒருமொழிகளையும் அவற்றின் பொருள்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) பே - 1. வறுமை\n(b) பை - 2. மேகம்\n(c) நோ - 3. புல்\n(d) வை - 4. இளமை"}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: பே - மேகம் (2), பை - இளமை (4), நோ - வறுமை (1), வை - புல் (3). சரியான பொருத்தம்: a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the subtle single-letter words with their meanings:\n(a) Pae (பே) - 1. Poverty (Varumai)\n(b) Pai (பை) - 2. Cloud (Maegam)\n(c) No (நோ) - 3. Grass (Pul)\n(d) Vai (வை) - 4. Youthfulness (Ilamai)"}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: Pae -> Cloud (2), Pai -> Youth (4), No -> Poverty (1), Vai -> Grass (3). Correct match is a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "பே", "content_en": "Pae"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "பை", "content_en": "Pai"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "நோ", "content_en": "No"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "வை", "content_en": "Vai"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "வறுமை", "content_en": "Poverty"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "மேகம்", "content_en": "Cloud"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "புல்", "content_en": "Grass"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "இளமை", "content_en": "Youthfulness"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference"