{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-410", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match-kurukka-examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குறுக்கச் சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் இலக்கண வகைகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) வையகம் - 1. மகரக் குறுக்கம்\n(b) வௌவால் - 2. ஐகாரக் குறுக்கம்\n(c) வலம்வந்தான் - 3. ஆய்தக் குறுக்கம்\n(d) முஃடீது - 4. ஔகாரக் குறுக்கம்"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-2, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: வையகம் (ஐகாரக் குறுக்கம்) -> 2, வௌவால் (ஔகாரக் குறுக்கம்) -> 4, வலம்வந்தான் (மகரக் குறுக்கம்) -> 1, முஃடீது (ஆய்தக் குறுக்கம்) -> 3. சரியான பொருத்தம்: a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the shortened words with their respective classifications:\n(a) Vaiyagam - 1. Magarak Kurukkam\n(b) Vowvaal - 2. Aigaarak Kurukkam\n(c) Valamvandhaan - 3. Aayudhak Kurukkam\n(d) Muhdeedhu - 4. Owgaarak Kurukkam"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-3, c-4, d-2", "B": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-2, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: Vaiyagam -> Aigaarak (2), Vowvaal -> Owgaarak (4), Valamvandhaan -> Magarak (1), Muhdeedhu -> Aayudhak (3). Correct match is a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "வையகம்", "content_en": "Vaiyagam"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "வௌவால்", "content_en": "Vowvaal"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "வலம்வந்தான்", "content_en": "Valamvandhaan"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "முஃடீது", "content_en": "Muhdeedhu"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "மகரக் குறுக்கம்", "content_en": "Magarak Kurukkam"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "ஐகாரக் குறுக்கம்", "content_en": "Aigaarak Kurukkam"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "ஆய்தக் குறுக்கம்", "content_en": "Aayudhak Kurukkam"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "ஔகாரக் குறுக்கம்", "content_en": "Owgaarak Kurukkam"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": null, "exam_name": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2 / VAO Benchmark", "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "match", "kurukka_examples_match"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-411", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match-tense-infixes", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பகுபத இடைநிலைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய கால வகைகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) த், ட், ற், இன் - 1. எதிர்கால இடைநிலை (செய்வான்)\n(b) கிறு, கின்று, ஆநின்று - 2. இறந்தகால இடைநிலை (செய்தான்)\n(c) ப், வ் - 3. எதிர்மறை இடைநிலை (காணலள்)\n(d) இல், அல், ஆ - 4. நிகழ்கால இடைநிலை (செய்கின்றான்)"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "D": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: த், ட், ற், இன் (இறந்தகாலம்) -> 2, கிறு, கின்று, ஆநின்று (நிகழ்காலம்) -> 4, ப், வ் (எதிர்காலம்) -> 1, இல், அல், ஆ (எதிர்மறை) -> 3. சரியான பொருத்தம்: a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Pagupatham infixes with their respective tenses/functions:\n(a) th, t, tr, in - 1. Future tense infix (Seyvaan)\n(b) kiru, kinru, aanru - 2. Past tense infix (Seydhaan)\n(c) p, v - 3. Negative infix (Kaanalal)\n(d) il, al, aa - 4. Present tense infix (Seykinraan)"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "D": "a-4, b-2, c-1, d-3"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: Past -> 2, Present -> 4, Future -> 1, Negative -> 3. Correct match is a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "த், ட், ற், இன்", "content_en": "th, t, tr, in"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "கிறு, கின்று, ஆநின்று", "content_en": "kiru, kinru, aanru"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "ப், வ்", "content_en": "p, v"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "இல், அல், ஆ", "content_en": "il, al, aa"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "எதிர்கால இடைநிலை (செய்வான்)", "content_en": "Future tense infix"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "இறந்தகால இடைநிலை (செய்தான்)", "content_en": "Past tense infix"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "எதிர்மறை இடைநிலை (காணலள்)", "content_en": "Negative infix"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "நிகழ்கால இடைநிலை (செய்கின்றான்)", "content_en": "Present tense infix"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 61, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": null, "exam_name": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2 / VAO Benchmark", "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "match", "tense_infixes_match"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-412", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "valaiyal-aigaaram-matra", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"வளையல்\" என்னும் சொல்லில் இடைநிலையாக அமைந்துள்ள 'ளை' (ள் + ஐ) என்னும் எழுத்தில் உள்ள ஐகாரக் குறுக்கத்தின் மாத்திரை அளவு எவ்வளவு?"}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டு (2) மாத்திரை", "B": "ஒன்றரை (1½) மாத்திரை", "C": "அரை (½) மாத்திரை", "D": "ஒரு (1) மாத்திரை"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: ஐகாரம் மொழிக்கு முதலில் வரும்போது 1½ மாத்திரையாகவும்; மொழிக்கு இடையிலும் இறுதியிலும் வரும்போது 1 மாத்திரையாகவும் ஒலிக்கும். 'வளையல்' என்பதில் இடையில் வந்துள்ளதால் 1 மாத்திரை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the exact metric duration (Mora) of the shortened 'Ai' in the medial syllable 'lai' of the word \"Valaiyal\"?"}], "options": {"A": "Two (2) morae", "B": "One and a half (1½) morae", "C": "Half (½) mora", "D": "One (1) mora"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: 'Ai' appearing in medial and final positions reduces to exactly one (1) mora. In 'Valaiyal', it occurs medially."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil