{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-417", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "odd-orezhuthu-meaning-pair", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நன்னூலார் வகுத்த ஓரெழுத்து ஒருமொழிகளுள் தவறாகப் பொருந்தியுள்ள (பொருந்தாத) இணை எது?"}], "options": {"A": "ஆ - பசு", "B": "ஊ - சோலை", "C": "ஏ - அம்பு", "D": "ஐ - தலைவன்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: 'ஊ' என்பதற்கு 'இறைச்சி' என்பதே நன்னூல் கூறும் பொருள். 'சோலை' என்பதைக் குறிக்கும் ஓரெழுத்து ஒருமொழி 'கா' ஆகும். எனவே 'ஊ - சோலை' தவறாகப் பொருந்திய பொருந்தாத இணை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following single-letter word-meaning pairs is MISMATCHED (odd one out)?"}], "options": {"A": "Aa - Cow", "B": "Oo - Grove", "C": "Ee - Arrow", "D": "Ai - Leader"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: 'Oo' signifies meat/flesh, whereas grove is 'Kaa'. Thus pair B is mismatched."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 60, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_no