{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-419", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "direct-owgaaram-initial-only", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: நால்வகை குறுக்கங்களுள் சொல்லின் இடையிலும் இறுதியிலும் வராமல் 'மொழிக்கு முதலில் மட்டுமே வரும் குறுக்கம்' எது?"}], "options": {"A": "ஔகாரக் குறுக்கம்", "B": "ஐகாரக் குறுக்கம்", "C": "மகரக் குறுக்கம்", "D": "ஆய்தக் குறுக்கம்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: ஔகாரம் சொல்லின் இடையிலும் இறுதியிலும் வராது; மொழிக்கு முதலில் மட்டுமே வரும் என்பதால் 'ஔகாரக் குறுக்கம்' மொழிக்கு முதலில் மட்டுமே அமையும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: Among the four types of shortened letters, which one occurs exclusively in word-initial position, never medially or finally?"}], "options": {"A": "Owgaarak Kurukkam", "B": "Aigaarak Kurukkam", "C": "Magarak Kurukkam", "D": "Aayudhak Kurukkam"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: Owgaarak Kurukkam occurs solely at the beginning of words, never in medial or terminal positions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": null, "exam_name": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2 / VAO Benchmark", "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "direct_mcq", "owgaaram_position_pyq"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-420", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "direct-miya-asaisol-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: 'மியா' என்பது ஓர் அசைச்சொல்; இதில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள 'மி'யில் உள்ள இகரம் எவ்வகைச் சார்பெழுத்து ஆகும்?"}], "options": {"A": "குற்றியலுகரம்", "B": "முற்றியலுகரம்", "C": "குற்றியலிகரம்", "D": "ஆய்தக் குறுக்கம்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: 'மியா' என்னும் அசைச்சொல்லில் உள்ள 'மி'யில் உள்ள இகரம் அரை மாத்திரையாகக் குறைந்து ஒலிக்கும் 'குற்றியலிகரம்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC PYQ: 'Miya' is an expletive clitic; what type of dependent letter (Saarbezhtthu) is the vowel in 'Mi'?"}], "options": {"A": "Kurriyalugaram", "B": "Mutriyalugaram", "C": "Kurriyaligaram", "D": "Aayudhak Kurukkam"}, "explanation": "TNPSC Grammar Fact: The vowel in 'Mi' of the particle 'Miya' is Kurriyaligaram, shortening to half mora."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 19, "chapter": null, 