{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-437", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-bridging", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match-sentence-structures", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொடர் இலக்கண எடுத்துக்காட்டுகளையும் அவற்றின் இலக்கணக் கூறுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) நீலன் படித்தான் - 1. வினாப் பயனிலை\n(b) படித்தாய் - 2. எழுவாய் & வினைப் பயனிலை\n(c) கரிகாலன் யார்? - 3. செயப்படுபொருள் கொண்ட முழுத் தொடர்\n(d) நான் கவிதை எழுதினேன் - 4. தோன்றா எழுவாய்"}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: நீலன் படித்தான் (எழுவாய்+பயனிலை) -> 2, படித்தாய் (தோன்றா எழுவாய்) -> 4, கரிகாலன் யார்? (வினாப் பயனிலை) -> 1, நான் கவிதை எழுதினேன் (கவிதை-செயப்படுபொருள்) -> 3. சரியான பொருத்தம்: a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the sentence examples with their precise syntactic structures:\n(a) Neelan paditthaan - 1. Interrogative Predicate\n(b) Paditthaai - 2. Subject & Verbal Predicate\n(c) Karikalan yaar? - 3. Full sentence with explicit Object\n(d) Naan kavithai ezhudhinaen - 4. Hidden Subject (Thondraa Ezhuvai)"}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Textbook Fact: Neelan paditthaan -> 2, Paditthaai -> 4, Karikalan yaar? -> 1, Naan kavithai ezhudhinaen -> 3. Correct match is a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "நீலன் படித்தான்", "content_en": "Neelan paditthaan"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "படித்தாய்", "content_en": "Paditthaai"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "கரிகாலன் யார்?", "content_en": "Karikalan yaar?"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "நான் கவிதை எழுதினேன்", "content_en": "Naan kavithai ezhudhinaen"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "வினாப் பயனிலை", "content_en": "Interrogative Predicate"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "எழுவாய் & வினைப் பயனிலை", "content_en": "Subject & Verbal Predicate"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "செயப்படுபொருள் கொண்ட முழுத் தொடர்", "content_en": "Sentence with Object"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "தோன்றா எழுவாய்", "content_en": "Hidden Subject"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 64, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": true, "exam": null, "exam_name": "TNPSC Group 4 / Group 2 / VAO Benchmark", "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "match", "sentence_syntax_match"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reaso