{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-442", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-bridging", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sandhi-definition-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பகுபத உறுப்புகளுள் பெரும்பாலும் பகுதிக்கும் இடைநிலைக்கும் இடையே இடம்பெறும் மெய்யெழுத்து எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்படும்?"}], "options": {"A": "சாரியை", "B": "சந்தி", "C": "விகாரம்", "D": "விகுதி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: பெரும்பாலும் பகுதிக்கும் இடைநிலைக்கும் இடையே இடம்பெறும் மெய்யெழுத்து 'சந்தி' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Among Pagupatham constituents, what is the term for the consonant occurring predominantly between the root and the infix?"}], "options": {"A": "Saariyai", "B": "Sandhi", "C": "Vikaaram", "D": "Viguthi"}, "explanation": "Textbook Fact: A consonant predominantly positioned between the root (Paguthi) and infix (Idainilai) is termed Sandhi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 61, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null},