{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-447", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-bridging", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "direct-jadav-jnu-title", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "2012-ஆம் ஆண்டு புதுதில்லி ஜவஹர்லால் நேரு பல்கலைக்கழகம் ஜாதவ் பயேங்கிற்கு வழங்கிய வரலாற்றுச் சிறப்புமிக்க பட்டம் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "இந்தியாவின் வனமனிதர் (Forest Man of India)", "B": "காடுகளின் காவலர்", "C": "இந்தியாவின் பறவை மனிதர்", "D": "பசுமைப் போராளி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: 2012-இல் ஜவஹர்லால் நேரு பல்கலைக்கழகம் ஜாதவ் பயேங்கிற்கு 'இந்தியாவின் வனமனிதர்' (Forest Man of India) என்ற பட்டத்தை வழங்கிச் சிறப்பித்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 2012, which prestigious title was conferred on Jadav Payeng by Jawaharlal Nehru University (JNU), New Delhi?"}], "options": {"A": "Forest Man of India", "B": "Guardian of Forests", "C": "Birdman of India", "D": "Green Crusader"}, "explanation": "Textbook Fact: In 2012, JNU conferred upon Jadav Payeng the title 'Forest Man of India'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "editio