{"id": "7th-t1-pyq-448", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u4-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "ta-pyq-bridging", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "direct-voc-wallace-name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பிரிட்டிஷ் அரசால் பறிக்கப்பட்ட வ.உ.சிதம்பரனாரின் வழக்கறிஞர் உரிமத்தை (Advocacy Sanad) மீண்டும் வழங்கி உதவிய ஆங்கிலேய நீதிபதியின் பெயர் என்ன?"}], "options": {"A": "நீதிபதி எலியட்", "B": "நீதிபதி பின்ஹே", "C": "நீதிபதி வாலஸ்", "D": "நீதிபதி காலின்ஸ்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: வ.உ.சிதம்பரனாருக்கு மீண்டும் வழக்கறிஞர் உரிமத்தை வழங்கிய ஆங்கிலேய நீதிபதி 'வாலஸ்' ஆவார். இதன் காரணமாகவே தம் மகனுக்கு 'வாலஸ்வரன்' என்று பெயரிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the name of the British Judge who restored the law practice license of V.O. Chidambaranar that had been revoked by colonial rulers?"}], "options": {"A": "Judge Eliot", "B": "Judge Pinhey", "C": "Judge Wallace", "D": "Judge Collins"}, "explanation": "Textbook Fact: British Judge Wallace restored V.O.C's law license, leading V.O.C to name his son 'Walaswaran' in appreciation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services C